CHDominoes
Copyright 2026 bateske

From CHBlackjack (https://github.com/bateske/CHBlackjack, Apache-2.0), by way
of CHChess and CHBackgammon: the input and frame pacing (the CHGame
library's chgame/Input.*), palette, drawing, outlined lettering, effects,
sound sequencer, flash saving, debug protocol and the PC simulator and
tools, adapted here; CHChess's pointing glove (tools/art/common/hand.png); and
CHCrossword's anti-aliased lettering (tools/aafont.py, after
../CHCrossword/tools/tilefont.py). CHBlackjack is a derivative of "Blackjack" for the
Arduboy by Press Play On Tape (Apache-2.0); the 3x5 pixel font in the CHGame
library (platform/board/arduino/CHGame/libraries/CHGame/src/chgame/Draw.cpp) is Press Play On
Tape's.

The serif lettering (tools/art/aafont.txt) is rasterized from DejaVu Serif
Bold by tools/aafont.py. DejaVu is freely redistributable: Bitstream Vera
Fonts Copyright (c) 2003 Bitstream, Inc.; DejaVu changes are in the public
domain (https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/License.html).

Everything else - the rules, the CPU, the table's layout, the tiles, the
game flow and the presentation - is new, under the Apache License 2.0
(LICENSE).
